AB  - In this paper we aim to present outcomes from the evaluation and deployment of the TYPHON H2020 project (The TYPHON project receives funding under the European Unions Horizon 2020 Research and Innovation Programme under grant agreement No. 780251) in a container-based production ecosystem supported by Hellenic Telecommunications Organization S.A. (OTE). The main objective is to implement a successful production-ready deployment following best practices in terms of infrastructure, monitoring and high availability while achieving analysis in real-time of massive streams of data. Moreover, our intent is to evaluate the TYPHON architecture when integrated by a Telecom Industry user and present the benefits of its adaptation by IT Units for predictive maintenance purposes. © 2021, IFIP International Federation for Information Processing.
