TI  - Leveraging Big Data and AI for Improved Energy Efficiency in MENA Utilities: A Framework for Consumption Management and Operational Insights
PY  - 2026
T2  - Lecture Notes in Networks and Systems
VL  - 1539 LNNS
SP  - 143
EP  - 156
DO  - 10.1007/978-981-96-9248-4_11
