AB  - The Dual-side water pumping water system is designed to achieve continuous and uninterrupted water flow for agricultural and industrial purposes. The system is powered by the scotch yoke mechanism to provide the pumping action. The system performance was very crucial to measure with the precise controller model. Implementing the IoT to monitor and control water flow rate, pressure level, vibration level, and pump status. The IoT-enabled PLC controller processes the data and push to the cloud data warehouse to ensure variation in the pressure level and flow. The system communication protocols like MQTT and HTTP to continuous data transfer to predict the variation for maintenance activities. In this system, water pumps will be operated bidirectionally to suck the high-velocity fluid with high pressure to achieve the continuous water flow. The microcontroller performs the decision-making algorithm to control the pump's actuation and flow rate. The system proposed automatic system increases the system efficiency by 25% as compared to the initial phase to support the water delivery to ensure energy-efficient and seamless water flow.  © 2025 IEEE.
