AB  - Under the background of the continuous expansion of the scale and capacity of power grid and the sharp increase of information measurement points, the amount of data that needs to be analyzed and processed is growing geometrically. It is urgent to carry out the research of massive information intelligent collection and efficient computing processing scheme and storage scheme. In this paper, combined with the actual demand of monitoring data access and lossless compression method in engineering practice, we build Hadoop cloud cluster platform and hive distributed data warehouse, take analog measurement data set as cluster compression object, realize the effective compression and storage of measurement information, which has important theoretical significance and practical value for solving power grid large data processing. © 2021 IEEE.
